---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="">
<main class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-5/6 sm:w-9/12 md:w-8/12 lg:w-7/12 xl:w-6/12 2xl:w-5/12 mx-auto py-4 h-screen selection:bg-solar-base-1 selection:text-solar-base-04">
    <nav class="font-semibold font-mono w-full selection:bg-solar-base-03 selection:text-solar-base-3">
        <ul class="flex">
            <li class="bg-solar-base-3 text-solar-base-03 px-2 hover:bg-solar-green-700"><a href="#about">Home</a></li>
            <li class="bg-solar-base-3 text-solar-base-03 px-2 hover:bg-solar-green-700"><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
            <li class="bg-solar-base-3 text-solar-base-03 px-2 hover:bg-solar-green-700"><a href="#project">Project</a></li>
            <li class="bg-solar-base-3 text-solar-base-03 px-2 hover:bg-solar-green-700"><a href="#social">Social</a></li>
            <li class="bg-solar-base-3 text-solar-base-03 px-2 hover:bg-solar-green-700"><a href="/ssh">ssh</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-solar-base-3 pt-4">Want interactive terminal? <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/ssh"><span class="text-solar-green-500">ssh</span> derk0.de<span class="text-solar-base-04 bg-solar-base-3 animate-pulse">v</span><a/></p>
    </nav>
    <section id="about" class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:text-lg font-mono">
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 items-center focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">0</span>
            <h1 class="text-solar-blue-300 font-bold font-mono w-fit"># Hello</h1>
        </div>
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">1</span>
            <h2 class="text-solar-blue-300 font-bold font-mono w-fit">## My Name is Chason Li.</h2>
        </div>
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">2</span>
            <p class="text-solar-base-1 text-justify">I'm a computer engineer at [unemployed] comfortable with both front-end & back-end development as well as embedded development to some degree.</p>
        </div>
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">3</span>
            <p class="text-solar-base-1 text-justify">I'm passionate about building CLI based applications and developer tooling, and optimizing program performance in different levels. Making QOL extensions and plugins for applications and games I used and played in a daily biased is also my primary interest. This goes the same with tinkering embedded hardware & ICs.</p>
        </div>
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">4</span>
            <p class="text-solar-base-1 text-justify">My works have a strong emphasis on <i>simplicity</i> and <i>performance</i>. I’m deeply care about implementation detail of my work to ensure they are <a href="https://www.computerenhance.com/p/table-of-contents" target="_blank" class="text-[#F7CD43] font-bold font-mono">blazingly fast</a> and <a href="https://suckless.org/philosophy/" target="_blank" class="text-[#1177AA] font-bold font-mono">suckless</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">5</span>
            <p class="text-solar-base-1 text-justify">I’m currently based in Canada. If you happen to speak Chinese, my Chinese name is 李承轩 (lǐ chéng xuān)..</p>
        </div>
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">6</span>
            <p class="text-solar-base-1 text-justify">You can message me via my <a class="bg-solar-base-3 text-solar-base-03 px-2 hover:bg-solar-green-700" href="#social">Social</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="experience" class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:text-lg font-mono">
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">7</span>
            <h2 class="text-solar-blue-300 font-bold font-mono w-fit">## Experience</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="flex gap-4 text-solar-base-1">
            <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
                <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">8</span>
                <li>University of Alberta - Bachelor of Science In Computer Engineering</li>
            </div>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section id="experience" class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:text-lg font-mono">
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-10 pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">9</span>
            <h2 class="text-solar-blue-300 font-bold font-mono w-fit">## Project</h2>
        </div>
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-8 focus:pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">10</span>
            <p class="text-solar-base-1">This section is still under construction.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="social" class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:text-lg font-mono">
        <div tabindex="0" class="flex gap-8 focus:pl-2 focus:border-solar-orange-500 focus:border-l-2 items-center">
            <span class="text-solar-yellow-700 text-center self-start">11</span>
            <h2 class="text-solar-blue-300 font-bold font-mono w-fit">## Social</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-solar-base-1">
            <li></li>
            <li></li>
            <li></li>
            <li></li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</main>
</Layout>
